{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30404","headline":"淛东赠李副使员外 · 赵嘏","name":"淛东赠李副使员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙尽戎机佐上台，少年清苦自霜台。\n马嘶深竹闲宜贵，花拂朱衣美称才。\n早入半缘分务重，晚吟多是看山回。\n名高渐少翻飞伴，几度烟霄独去来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}